 "notes": [
  "Rows 2026-11-20 (lane houthavens-memel-wiborg-20261120, round 5): every front from w01-138s1 (SE, 2021), w02-318s2 (NW, 2021) and w03-228s1/s2 (SW, 2022/2025): a dark grey concrete frame of five storeys, glazed floor to ceiling on every storey behind projecting concrete floor galleries with mesh rails (terraces at every upper floor and a thin roof slab), concrete columns every 6-7 m (terraces.posts 6.5). The NE front is not photographed square and takes the SW scheme.",
